KEY ASSUMPTIONS & LIMITATIONS (disclosed)
======================================================================
- No income variable in data; 1985 baseline WEALTH used as proxy for income/economic level.
- Descriptive association, NOT causation; selection/confounding bias (jailed group is 90% male, lower 1985 wealth).
- ever_jailed is binary (jailed 1985-1994), no duration/timing; 1990 is mid-window, 1996 post-window.
- Only sex available as a simple control; no other covariates.
- Small jailed cells (n=76/39/44); low power; composite wealth has zeros/negatives, right-skewed, not inflation-adjusted.
